<title>UK: LW Rentenbank sets 10 billion peseta bond.</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank sets 10 billion peseta bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banco Central Hispano.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDWIRTSCHAFTLICHE RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT     10 BLN ESP   COUPON    *7.60	MATURITY    07.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.895   PAY DATE    07.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     LISTING    MADRID    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES     *STEPS UP TO 7.8 PERCENT FOR YEARS SIX TO 10.</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SPANISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
